>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `LINARITH_ext_ss`

``` hol4
linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss : simpExtLib.ssfrag
linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss_budgeted :
  Context.t -> searchBudget.budget -> simpExtLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Provides the explicitly tracked linear-arithmetic fragment.

These fragments lift the same ordinary reducer closures used by
`LINARITH_ss` and `LINARITH_ss_budgeted`. Choose the extension fragment
before installation into an extension simpset; ordinary `LINARITH_ss`
and ordinary reducer/destructor clients remain ordinary. Do not promote
an already compiled ordinary set.

### Failure

As for [`LINARITH_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ss), except that the reducer
of `LINARITH_ext_ss_budgeted` raises `searchBudget.LimitReached` when its
budget is exhausted.

### Example

``` hol4
val arithmetic_ss = simpExtLib.++
  (simpExtLib.lift_simpset (BasicProvers.srw_ss ()),
   linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss);
```

